      "kind": "drawing",
      "note": "The design was read from his drawing of a tile from Toledo, 1500-25 (Victoria and Albert Museum 357-1876). He lists the same design in the Bou Inania madrasa in Fez (David Wade, MOR 2816x). The construction is ours."
